Inclusion Criteria:

* 18 years to 75 years old (including boundary values), patients with advanced or metastatic breast cancer;
* ECOG PS Score: 0\~1;
* Based on RECIST v1.1, at least one measurable lesion;
* Patients must have a life expectancy ≥ 3 months;
