* Renal function: serum creatinine is greater than 1.5 times that of ULN;
* Other abnormal laboratory test results, which may affect the subject's completion of the test or interfere with the test results as assessed by the investigator; Test could be repeated during the screening period for the false individual test results, or value near the limit, or inconclusive results, or according to the investigator's judgement. After re-test, subjects should not be randomized if the results still meet the above conditions;
