2. Receipt of antitumour therapy (excluding hydroxyurea and prophylactic intrathecal injections) such as chemotherapy, immunotherapy, targeted therapy, or biological therapy within 4 weeks or 5 half-lives (whichever is shorter) prior to the first study drug administration; receipt of radiotherapy within 2 weeks; receipt of traditional Chinese herbal medicine within 2 weeks;
